app
  ctrl+c  ^c  quit  on
  ?       ?   help  off

finder
  ctrl+t  ^t   open in tree    on
  tab     tab  preview         on
  ctrl+o  ^o   open on GitHub  on

find (types)
  up ctrl+p    ↑     up         on
  down ctrl+n  ↓     down       on
  pgup         pgup  page up    on
  pgdown       pgdn  page down  on
  enter        ↵     open       on
  esc          esc   close      on
